df['CreditScore_Normalized'] = df['CreditScore'] / df['CreditScore'].max()
# Feature description
# This scales CreditScore to be in the range [0, 1] using the maximum value as the reference point.
# Usefulness: Normalizing the CreditScore feature eliminates scale issues and emphasizes individual credit behavior compared to the dataset. It allows algorithms sensitive to magnitude differences to better process this variable.
end

