df['credit_income_ratio'] = df['CreditScore'] / (df['Income'] + 1e-5)
# Feature description
# This feature calculates the relationship between CreditScore and scaled Income levels. 
# Usefulness: It provides insight into whether an individual’s credit score aligns with their income capacity. Individuals with high credit scores compared to income could signify financial prudence or potential over-reliance on credit.
end

